# LiveMinutes secrets for the whole repo (every component reads this one file).
# Copy to .env in the repo root (gitignored, never commit it):  cp .env.example .env
# Format: KEY=value, no quotes, no spaces around "=". Other settings live in each component's settings.py.
# (Not the same as 1_ingestion/attendee/.env, which is Attendee's own config, generated in README section 1.4.)

# ---- 1. Ingestion ----

# Attendee API key, so the bridge and send_bot.sh can create bots, pause/resume them and post in chat.
# Easiest: ./make_account.sh you@example.com  (creates a login + key and writes it here)
# By hand: http://localhost:8000 -> log in -> API Keys -> Create API Key -> copy (shown only once).
ATTENDEE_API_KEY=

# Groq API key for Whisper speech-to-text (free tier is enough):
# https://console.groq.com/keys -> Create API Key -> copy (starts with gsk_).
# Groq blocks VPN / datacenter IPs (403 "Access denied"): turn your VPN off.
GROQ_API_KEY=
